# MacOs
⌘ + h -> hide
⌘ + , -> open preferances
⌘ + ⌥ +h -> hide all but current
⌘ + q -> quit 
⌘ + t -> New tab
⌘ + m -> minimize 
⌘ + n -> new window 
⌘ + ~ -> switch window of same app 
⌘ + s -> save
⌘ + ⇧ + s -> save as
⌘ + ⌥ + ⎋ -> force quit

## Finder
⌘ + ⇧ + C -> Computer
⌘ + ⇧ + H -> Home
⌘ + ⇧ + I -> Icloud
⌘ + ⇧ + A -> Applications
⌘ + ⇧ + F -> Recents
⌘ + ⇧ + G -> Goto folder

## Safari
⌘ + l -> edit search bar
⌘ + f -> search
⌘ + g -> next instace of search result
⌘ + ⇧ + g -> previous instace of search result
⌘ + ⇧ + n -> new incognito window 
⌘ + [ -> go back
⌘ + ] -> go forward
⌘ + w -> close tab
⌘ + y -> history 
⌘ + ⇧ + t -> reopen last closed tab
⌘ + z -> reopen last closed tab
⌘ + 1..8 -> switch to tab number <n>
⌘ + 9 -> swtich to the last tab 
⌃ + tab -> scroll through the tabs
fn + ↓ -> page up 
fn + ↑ -> page up 

## Screenshots
⌘ + ⇧ + 3 -> take full screenshot 
⌘ + ⇧ + 4 -> select area
⌘ + ⇧ + 5 -> capture or record 

